    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……以上就是我知晓的所有情报。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Nanoka001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "她给我留下的录像<br>\n是有关这座监牢的所有情报。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（没想到竟然隐藏着这样的秘密……<br>\n　原来一切的罪魁祸首是【大魔女】……）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（但奈叶香<br>\n　为什么要把这些情报留给我……？）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你一定很奇怪，<br>\n为什么我要把情报发送给你吧。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Nanoka002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "画面中的奈叶香像在回答我的疑问一般<br>\n诉说起来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "说实话，我自己也不知道为什么。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Nanoka003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过，我觉得你能够揭露这座监牢，不，<br>\n你能揭露魔女的所有秘密。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Nanoka004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以万一我出了什么事，就托付给你了。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Nanoka005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 65, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "请你一定要查明真相。<br>\n还有，<br>\n不要再让像我这样的魔女继续产生了。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Nanoka006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 67, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "因为，我不希望任何人再继续牺牲了。<br>\n……拜托你了，二阶堂希罗。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv21_Nanoka007"]}},
